OL,3,GNEWSACancer treatment review finds
OL,4,A'betrayal of trust'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrain cancer patients were routinely
OL,7,Fgiven extended, nonb@Qstandard courses
OL,8,Fof chemotherapy, with some being
OL,9,Fmisdiagnosed and exposed to serious
OL,10,Frisks and harm, a review has found.
OL,12,FThe Royal College of Physicians (RCP)
OL,13,Fis investigating 20 cases in which
OL,14,Fpatients in Coventry were prescribed
OL,15,Fthe drug temozolomide (TMZ) for long
OL,16,Fperiods with "little or no evidence of
OL,17,Fbenefit," it said.
OL,19,FPreliminary findings of the review,
OL,20,Fleaked to the BBC, said staff failings
OL,21,Famounted to a "betrayal of patient
OL,22,Ftrust".
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
